WEBVTT

00:16:56.755 --> 00:17:03.066
because GPHIN found
the pandemic-to-be of SARS

00:17:03.090 --> 00:17:09.128
three months before WHO actually
announced it, and because of that,

00:17:09.152 --> 00:17:12.318
we were able to stop the SARS pandemic.

00:17:12.342 --> 00:17:14.423
And I think we owe
a great debt of gratitude

00:17:14.447 --> 00:17:16.604
to GPHIN and to Ron St. John,

00:17:16.628 --> 00:17:20.079
who I hope is in the audience
some place -- over there --

00:17:20.103 --> 00:17:21.976
who's the founder of GPHIN.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.483
(Applause)

00:17:23.507 --> 00:17:24.976
Hello, Ron!

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:31.800
(Applause)